Squad Tools - local non-commercial prototype

This project references the game parameters and calculation design of SquadCalc.
Original project: https://github.com/sh4rkman/SquadCalc
Original author: Maxime "sharkman" Boussard, copyright (c) 2026.

This prototype is provided for non-commercial use under the conditions in the
accompanying third_party/SquadCalc.LICENSE. That complete copyright and license
notice must accompany copies or redistribution of this project.

No license to Squad SDK map images, icons, heightmaps, or other game assets is
granted by this notice. The local portable build includes separately downloaded
map data for the user's local use, attributed to Offworld Industries and the
SquadCalc data service. See maps/README.md (assets/maps/README.md in source).
These game assets are excluded from Git and are not covered by the code license.
